WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,740
Liu Yang is worried and asked me to come find you.

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:09,430
Well, I'll go first then

3
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:12,070
You can keep those blessings and medicines.

4
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:13,870
Maybe it can be used in photography

5
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:20,540
Thank you. My name is Jiang Xian.

6
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,790
S is from the emergency department of the hospital

7
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:25,120
I was on vacation with my husband

8
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:28,800
Zhao was temporarily received back and reinstated at the Second Hospital of the Safety Zone.

9
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:33,990
She is my high school teacher

10
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:37,310
I met her on the road, but I didn’t have any medicine in my hand.

11
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:39,340
you helped me a lot today

12
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:42,020
If you need anything in the future, just come to me

13
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,900
Do me a favor and wear some clothes on my thighs

14
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:50,700
The young man must be two meters tall, right?

15
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:53,540
Not that tall. My son is 1.9 meters tall.

16
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:56,980
Looks similar to her

17
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:58,580
It turns out this girl can talk.

18
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,100
I thought she wouldn't say it

19
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,500
People just don’t talk much
